# Ferrell, Tsai & Yang (2011) Cell 144:874 -- two-variable CDK1/APC model.
# CDK1 is made at a1 and destroyed via active APC; CDK1 activates APC
# (fraction 0..1). Two-variable negative feedback: damped oscillations
# into a stable spiral (no limit cycle).
# CHECK the form and values against the paper's Figure 3 before reporting.
par a1=0.1, b1=3, a2=3, b2=1, K=0.5, n=8
CDK1'=a1 - b1*CDK1*APC^n/(K^n + APC^n)
APC'=a2*(1-APC)*CDK1^n/(K^n + CDK1^n) - b2*APC
init CDK1=0, APC=0
@ total=50
done
